  "notes": "{硬|かた}い is an i-adjective meaning hard, stiff, or rigid.\n\nFORMS:\n- {硬|かた}くない: not hard\n- {硬|かた}くて: hard and...\n- {硬|かた}かった: was hard\n\nKANJI DISTINCTION:\n- {硬|かた}い: physically hard (stone, meat)\n- {堅|かた}い: firm, reliable, solid (person, plan)\n- {固|かた}い: tight, stuck (knot, lid)\n\nCOMMON USES:\n- {硬|かた}い{石|いし}: hard stone\n- {体|からだ}が{硬|かた}い: inflexible body\n- {表情|ひょうじょう}が{硬|かた}い: stiff expression\n- {頭|あたま}が{硬|かた}い: inflexible thinking\n\nOPPOSITE:\n{柔|やわ}らかい: soft, flexible",
